      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Derafrog made a very good video on this problem. I believe VRChat is actively advertising and promoting the use of AI with their creators. The silence is them speaking, saying that AI is ok to use on their platform.\n\nI highly reccomend that you stop paying for VRC+ and not to spend on the creator economy.\n\nThis enshitification is disgusting.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R0QVOH_DT_w",
